  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). A Glass King's knight in polished obsidian armour, still guarding a road that leads nowhere. His blade cone is plain, but he flashes sunlight off his shield in a long glare that weakens you, and his reflections land on random players. At 60% two glasswings answer his horn. At 30% his armour cracks: a get-in-close ring and four-way lines of flying splinters.",
  "party": "Open world elite. Solo: tough — the glare is easy to stand in. 2-3: intended. 5+: quick. M5 scaling: health by players tagged; glasswings 2 -> 3 at five; reflections +1 per extra player.",
  "hpMult": 1.6,
  "arena": {
    "radius": 26
  },
  "say": {
    "pull": [
      "Halt. The road is closed by order of the Glass Kings.",
      "The knight raises a shield so bright you can see yourself in it."
    ],
    "death": "The Mirror Knight kneels. 'The road... is open.' Then he shatters.",
    "reset": "The Mirror Knight returns to his post."
  },
  "abilities": {
    "blade": {
      "id": "blade",
      "name": "Obsidian Blade",
      "every": [
        6,
        8
      ],
      "first": 2,
      "range": 6,
      "telegraphs": [
        {
          "shape": "cone",
